# The "Lunch is served" gallery pass (Features/10-gallery-scenes.feature) on Nelim's sanctuary (Nelims-tribe), PickleTools docs/GALERIE.md.
# Every pawn picture uses Venus Touch Waistlines + TailorMade and the legless body retexture (owner, 2026-10-07): the same list as
# APerfectMindInAPerfectBody/Tests/Pickle/wsl-deps.gallery-tmw.map and VenusTouchWaistlines (its gallery map), whose seeds are copied
# into config/gallery-scenes/ (AB's trousers need theirs; Venus Touch's has the full-body shirt option ON).
# Female Body Variants and Female Apparel Variants load BEFORE WDI (WDI declares loadAfter on both); TailorMade after the body mods.
# Rustic Meal Retexture (Jelheb, 1.6, no dependency, "load by the end of your mod list"): the meals on the table look like a rustic lunch.
# Development-only companions, never dependencies of Mod/About/About.xml.
# Select with -DepMap wsl-deps.gallery-scenes.map -Filter 10-gallery-scenes.feature.
nelim.pickletools.screenshotmode   path:PickleTools/ScreenshotMode/Mod
nelim.pickletools.screenshotstudio path:PickleTools/ScreenshotStudio/Mod
nelim.pickletools.camerazoom       path:PickleTools/CameraZoom/Mod
nelim.pickletools.stagedecor       path:PickleTools/StageDecor/Mod
nelim.pickletools.clearscreen      path:PickleTools/ClearScreen/Mod
nelim.pickletools.inspecttabs      path:PickleTools/InspectTabs/Mod
nelim.pickletools.coatsteps        path:PickleTools/CoatSteps/Mod
nelim.pickletools.colonistrace     path:PickleTools/ColonistRace/Mod
# The bundle is committed under PickleTools/Mod: this shell replaces it, so the tools above are the only copy of their steps (see StandaloneBase).
nelim.pickletools                  path:PickleTools/Tests/Pickle/StandaloneBase/Mod
